  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This Seacrest Beach (five min walk to Rosemary) home offers a rare combination of a private retreat, while being right in the middle of the amazing Seacrest, Rosemary, and Alys Beach neighborhoods. Located less than a mile from the white sugar sands of the Gulf, this luxury home is ready to host your large gathering with 5 bedrooms, 5.5 baths, a screened-in porch, bonus room, and private heated pool! For a change of scenery, enjoy the 12,000 sq ft resort pool, walk to restaurants, or explore 30A on one of the 4 provided bikes!<br><br>The space<br>Walk to Beach or ride the Private Tram to the beach access! | 2 Master Bedrooms | Central A/C | 2,750 Sq Ft<br><br>With multiple entertainment spaces inside and out, this home provides the perfect Gulf getaway for group reunions, full-family vacations, and fun-in-the-sun celebrations! Now includes SONOS amp for music throughout living room, screened in porch, and pool area. Either play music through SONOS or airplay your music throughout house.<br><br>Master Bedroom: King Bed | Master Bedroom 2: King Bed | Bedroom 3: 2 Twin Bunk Beds, 2 Twin Trundle Beds | Bedroom 4: Queen Bed | Bedroom 5: Queen Bed<br><br>OUTDOOR LIVING: Covered patio w/ flat-screen TV & ceiling fans, lounge furniture, dining area, propane grill, 4 bicycles, private pool (heated to 85 degrees).<br><br>INDOOR LIVING: Modern decor, 7 Smart TVs, screened-in porch w/ wall-to-wall windows, farmhouse-style dining table, bonus room w/ mini-fridge<br><br>KITCHEN: Fully equipped w/ cookware, dishware & utensils, 1-cup coffee maker, oven, electric cooktop, microwave, high-top bar w/ seating<br><br>GENERAL: Free WiFi, keyless entry, washer/dryer, linens & towels, hair dryers, Pack ‘N Play, high chair, beach towels<br><br>NOTE: We allow certain breeds of non-shedding dogs. Please ask before booking if your dog will be allowed.<br><br>PARKING: Driveway 2 vehicles; trailer parking prohibited overflow parking allowed on street up to 4 vehicles total, permits provided by security.<br><br>SECURITY: There are two Nest Cameras on the property. One is at the front door and the other is on the back porch overlooking the back gate. These are monitored for access only.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "5 BR 30A Seacrest Beach Home with PRIVATE HEATED POOL"
        }
      ],
